   "title": "Not responding: FIRST look for the TREATABLE causes",
   "lines": [
    "shock or low blood pressure · low glucose · diabetic ketoacidosis · hypertensive encephalopathy · drug intoxication",
    "bacterial or fungal meningitis · herpes simplex encephalitis · brain abscess · epidural or subdural hematoma",
    "then EXAMINE: is the patient AWAKE (alertness) and AWARE (awareness)?"
   ]
  },
